Section: 1 Introduction
Text: A better alternative would be to provide addi- tional evidence that will allow a user to evaluate multiple viewpoints and decide with which they agree. To this end, we propose 360° Stance De- tection, a tool that provides a wide view of a topic from different perspectives to aid with forming a balanced opinion.

